<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Disclaimer | ShouldISpend</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Read the disclaimer for ShouldISpend financial decision calculators and educational spending tools."
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f5f7fa;
        --card: #ffffff;
        --text: #0d1b2a;
        --muted: #64748b;
        --border: #dbe3ee;
        --accent: #14b8a6;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .site-header {
        background: white;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 18px 32px;
      }

      .nav {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .logo span {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 80px 24px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 4rem;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #334155;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 32px 24px;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        h1 {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        .nav {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 18px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="nav">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Should<span>I</span>Spend</a>

        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/calculators">Calculators</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Website Disclaimer</div>

      <h1>Educational Estimates Only.</h1>

      <p>
        The calculators, verdicts, recommendations, and financial content on
        ShouldISpend are provided for general educational and informational
        purposes only.
      </p>

      <p>
        Nothing on this website should be considered financial advice,
        investment advice, tax advice, legal advice, or professional planning
        guidance.
      </p>

      <p>
        All financial situations are unique. The estimates and verdicts provided
        by these calculators are simplified models designed to help users think
        more critically about spending decisions, savings impact, debt load, and
        financial flexibility.
      </p>

      <p>
        Users should independently verify information and consult licensed
        financial professionals before making major financial decisions.
      </p>

      <p>
        ShouldISpend makes no guarantees regarding financial outcomes,
        affordability, investment performance, debt management success, or
        long-term financial results.
      </p>

      <p>
        By using this website, you acknowledge that all decisions made using the
        information provided are solely your responsibility.
      </p>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
      ShouldISpend © 2026 — Practical financial decision tools and calculators.
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>